d dark areas, but also solve mind-bending puzzles revolving around Light &amp; Shadow. Strategically manipulate your environment to control the shadows indirectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/90c5afda3183cb67f5e2a683ade803ec.poster.avif?t=1730487672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/90c5afda3183cb67f5e2a683ade803ec.webm?t=1730487672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/90c5afda3183cb67f5e2a683ade803ec.mp4?t=1730487672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/415c1f494c08d5f0456a65df1f51edfc.webp?t=1730487672\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Force Missiles</strong> always find their target, but <i>which</i> target is up to you. Destroy obstacles, manipulate the environment, and reposition yourself to control the route that your missiles take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/51635e8a84f849c93b8f53e88d3efd3a.poster.avif?t=1730487672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/51635e8a84f849c93b8f53e88d3efd3a.webm?t=1730487672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/51635e8a84f849c93b8f53e88d3efd3a.mp4?t=1730487672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/12f2664eefc50236c50cb83aa3b2a176.webp?t=1730487672\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fireball</strong> opens new avenues to explore while you progress deeper into the icy cold Valley of Shadow. Carve through ice to make a path for Force Missile, or melt snow to shine Light on the other side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/6bcd04194084ef44804e40980df5e7fa.webp?t=1730487672\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/81dfd661d1097e96f8b3b3fc3f20df36.poster.avif?t=1730487672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/81dfd661d1097e96f8b3b3fc3f20df36.webm?t=1730487672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/81dfd661d1097e96f8b3b3fc3f20df36.mp4?t=1730487672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/b13aa0640874d928e8778b8160d79c9a.webp?t=1730487672\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Valley of Shadow is both a treasure and a tomb of nostalgia from the 80's, 90's and the 2000's. Each piece is significant, and each one familiar to the player. Some of the most popular pieces even have their own puzzles designed for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/022f2e5749afee4f053b13266432ff0d.poster.avif?t=1730487672\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/022f2e5749afee4f053b13266432ff0d.webm?t=1730487672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414030/extras/022f2e5749afee4f053b13266432ff0d.mp4?t=1730487672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
